{"product_id":"arctic-abyss-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Arctic Abyss – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Elite Cue","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, elegant, and inspired by the mysterious depths of northern waters, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArctic Abyss\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural beauty of premium Canadian maple with the captivating movement of colored resin. Its design captures the contrast between organic wood grain and flowing resin artistry, creating a cue that feels both refined and distinctly modern.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a clean, sophisticated foundation, enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e flowing through rich shades of blue and violet. Each resin element is carefully shaped and integrated into the maple, creating a dynamic pattern with remarkable depth, movement, and individuality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe design continues through the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom resin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, carrying the same artistic character into the handle for a seamless contemporary aesthetic. Decorative \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides clean transitions and visual balance throughout the cue, while the precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e ensures a secure and accurate connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the Arctic Abyss reflects the craftsmanship, precision, and creativity behind every Elite Cue creation. It is a distinctive expression of modern cue artistry—where natural materials and handcrafted resin come together to create something truly one of a kind.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandle \/ Grip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Decorative Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Elite Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural maple. Flowing resin. Modern artistry. The Arctic Abyss is handcrafted for those who appreciate a cue unlike any other.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484542566448,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/456.png?v=1786593942","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/arctic-abyss-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}